 "summary": "The higher-order composition bound and the isometry-invariance lemma for `eLpNormWkp` are new: main has only the order-one bound `exists_eLpNormWkp_one_comp_le` and no `eLpNormWkp` equality for linear isometric equivalences. The proof reuses `exists_eLpNormWkp_succ_compL_le`, `eLpNormWkp_clm_comp_le` and the existing monotonicity and weak-derivative lemmas, and the PR replaces the inline ULift transfer in `ChainRule/Continuity/Higher.lean` with the new lemma.",
